    {
      "name": "Dark stage timer",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "stage",
      "description": "Speaker, idle countdown and next speaker. Source: base .ov family plus workspace overrides.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-stage\" aria-label=\"Current speaker timer\"><div class=\"ds-stage-top\"><span>READY</span><span>slot 8:00</span></div><div class=\"ds-stage-name\">Alex</div><div class=\"ds-stage-time\" role=\"timer\" aria-label=\"Time remaining\">8:00</div><div class=\"ds-stage-bar\"></div><div class=\"ds-stage-blocks\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class=\"ds-stage-next\">Next: <b>Morgan</b><small>gets 8:00</small></div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-stage{font-family:var(--f-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif);display:grid;gap:12px;background:var(--ov-bg,#131c29);color:var(--ov-fg,#f5f7fa);border:1px solid #263547;border-radius:14px;padding:24px 28px 22px;min-height:355px}.ds-stage-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;font-size:12px;color:var(--ov-muted,#aab7c8)}.ds-stage-name{font-size:30px;line-height:1.3;min-height:39px;font-weight:550;letter-spacing:-.5px;margin-top:5px}.ds-stage-time{font-family:var(--f-num,ui-monospace,'Cascadia Mono',Consolas,monospace);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-size:clamp(78px,8.8vw,124px);font-weight:650;line-height:1.12;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:3px 0 10px;color:var(--ov-muted,#aab7c8)}.ds-stage-bar{height:4px;border-radius:3px;background:var(--ov-line,#344050)}.ds-stage-blocks{display:flex;gap:3px;height:6px}.ds-stage-blocks i{flex:1;border-radius:2px;background:var(--ov-up,#394757)}.ds-stage-next{font-size:18px;line-height:1.2;color:var(--ov-muted,#aab7c8);margin-top:9px}.ds-stage-next b{font-weight:550;color:var(--ov-fg,#f5f7fa)}.ds-stage-next small{display:block;font-size:12px;margin-top:4px}@media(max-width:560px){.ds-stage{padding:21px 20px 19px;min-height:320px}.ds-stage-time{font-size:clamp(76px,22vw,103px)}.ds-stage-name{font-size:27px}.ds-stage-next{font-size:17px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Plan and actual lanes",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "timeline",
      "description": "Distinct timing lanes. Static sample of source docs/base.css .lane/.seg; inline percentages represent data.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-track\" aria-label=\"Planned and actual time\"><div class=\"ds-lane\"><span class=\"ds-seg ds-past\" style=\"left:0;width:33%\">Alex</span><span class=\"ds-seg ds-current\" style=\"left:33%;width:34%\">Morgan</span><span class=\"ds-seg ds-upcoming\" style=\"left:67%;width:33%\">Jordan</span></div><div class=\"ds-lane\"><span class=\"ds-seg ds-early\" style=\"left:0;width:30%\">Early</span><span class=\"ds-seg ds-live\" style=\"left:30%;width:20%\">Live</span></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-track{font-family:var(--f-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif);position:relative;padding-top:4px}.ds-lane{position:relative;height:22px;border-radius:5px;background:var(--soft,#edf1f7);overflow:hidden}.ds-lane+.ds-lane{margin-top:6px}.ds-seg{position:absolute;top:0;bottom:0;border-right:2px solid var(--panel,#fff);display:flex;align-items:center;padding-left:6px;font-size:12px;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;color:var(--fg,#182329)}.ds-past{background:color-mix(in srgb,#4F74E3 38%,transparent)}.ds-current{background:linear-gradient(90deg,color-mix(in srgb,var(--ok,#17905A) 52%,transparent) 50%,color-mix(in srgb,var(--ok,#17905A) 22%,transparent) 50%);font-weight:600}.ds-upcoming{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--muted,#5f6975) 20%,transparent)}.ds-early{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ok,#17905A) 32%,transparent)}.ds-live{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ok,#17905A) 22%,transparent)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Settings disclosure",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "settings",
      "description": "Native disclosure with open-state icon. Source: workspace summary/.settings-panel and base settings fields.",
      "html": "<details class=\"ds-settings\"><summary>Timing &amp; floating settings<svg class=\"ds-plus\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"ds-settings-body\"><label>Minimum slot, min<input type=\"number\" value=\"1\" min=\"0\" step=\".25\"></label><label>Amber warning, min left<input type=\"number\" value=\"1\" min=\"0\" step=\".25\"></label></div></details>",
      "css": ".ds-settings{font-family:var(--f-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif);background:var(--panel,#fff);color:var(--fg,#182329);border:1px solid var(--line,#dce1e6);border-radius:12px}.ds-settings summary{list-style:none;cursor:pointer;padding:19px 22px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-size:13px;font-weight:550}.ds-settings summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}.ds-settings[open] .ds-plus{transform:rotate(45deg)}.ds-settings summary:focus-visible,.ds-settings input:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#2d50cc);outline-offset:3px}.ds-settings-body{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:22px 20px;border-top:1px solid var(--line,#dce1e6);padding:20px 22px 22px}.ds-settings label{display:grid;align-content:start;gap:7px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted,#5f6975)}.ds-settings input{font-family:var(--f-num,ui-monospace,'Cascadia Mono',Consolas,monospace);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-size:12px;min-height:38px;background:#fafbfd;color:var(--fg,#182329);border:1px solid var(--line,#dce1e6);border-radius:6px;padding:5px 7px;min-width:0;width:100%}@media(max-width:560px){.ds-settings summary{padding:18px}.ds-settings-body{gap:19px 15px;padding-inline:17px}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Facilitator's control desk",
    "overview": "The confirmed visual commitment is a light workspace with a dark timer. Porcelain surfaces, ink text, cobalt actions, thin rules and consistent stroke icons keep the working controls quiet while the current speaker and countdown remain prominent. The interface opens directly into a usable tool.\n\nThis document captures the effective cascade at commit `cd4cc3c`: `docs/base.css` supplies timer mechanics and timing states; the later `docs/workspace.css` defines the public workspace appearance. Frontmatter values are normative extracted values, not a new stylesheet. Color names and descriptive language below identify their observed roles.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Light utility workspace and dark navy stage.",
      "System sans for controls; tabular monospace for time.",
      "Cobalt actions, restrained borders and modest corner radii.",
      "Separate planned and actual timing tracks.",
      "Stacked, touch-aware controls on small screens."
    ],
    "rules": [
